findings.llm_impact:
PackForAI's whole saving comes from not emitting table markup. MarkItDown spends about 124 tokens on 6 delimiter rows (4 spurious) and about 99 tokens on cell padding. Outside the tables PackForAI is 86 tokens LARGER:
- about 60 tokens of wrapper (title, 'Source file:' and 'Source type:' lines, '## Page N' headings, ```text fences);
- 95 two- or three-space runs at one token each (justified footnotes and double spaces after sentences);
- about 10 tokens from superscripts on their own lines.
These cost tokens without adding information.
